  "warnings": [],
  "working_thesis": "Human activities within the vita activa are fundamentally divided among labor (governed by biological necessity and the life process), work or fabrication (governed by utility, instruments, and world-building), and action/thought, with the modern age's elevation of labor and the animal laborans threatening the durability of the human world and the stability of the public realm."
